From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] user32, win32u: LoadKeyboardLayout[Ex], UnloadKeyboardLayout and the loaded layout list (3754)

LoadKeyboardLayoutA/W/Ex and UnloadKeyboardLayout were semi-stubs: Load returned
the default layout unless KLF_ACTIVATE worked, LoadEx ignored its first argument,
Unload failed with ERROR_CALL_NOT_IMPLEMENTED. The layouts a program loads now
form the session's keyboard layout list (GetKeyboardLayoutList), a loaded layout
of any language can be activated, and the user32 todo_wine lines of
test_LoadKeyboardLayoutEx pass. CORE review (patches/notes/3754.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---
